{
  "nl": "物料成本维护：单击单元格进入行内编辑；展示物料名称、成本，成本数字输入保留两位小数；支持新增、编辑、删除。",
  "nlEn": "Material cost maintenance: click a cell to edit inline. Shows material name and cost, where cost is a number input with two decimal places. Supports add, edit and delete.",
